: https://developers.openai.com/api/reference/resources/responses/methods/create and
: https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/reasoning and
: https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/function-calling
: read: 2026-09-26; the pages carry no revision date
: shape: documented event and item fields; ids, text, blobs, and the future model id
: are synthetic. The request set reasoning.summary auto, so summary events stream.
: output_item.added carries a partial encrypted_content; the docs say to replay the
: item from output_item.done. The call item id (fc_) differs from call_id (call_).
: One event type and one item field are unknown on purpose, and a keep-alive
: comment sits between records.

